---
/**
 * Ends one column of a slide and starts the next: the blocks before it fill
 * the first column, the blocks after it the second (a further `<Column />`
 * starts a third). A heading that opens the slide spans every column. It
 * renders a marker the deck reads at mount (lib/deck.ts).
 */
---

<div class="deck-marker" data-deck-marker="column" aria-hidden="true">Column</div>
